          <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
          <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"></line>
        </svg>
        Generate NFTs
      </h2>
      <p class="section-description">Create and preview NFT images for your collection. Keep on addind the NFTs you like to your seeds list (using 'Randomize' button for single generation or 'Generate Batch' for multiple Generations at once). Once you have the full collection seed list full you should proceed to the generate metadata tab. </p>
      <div class="generate-nfts-main-row" style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; width: 100%;">
        <div class="nft-preview-panel" style="flex: 0 0 440px; max-width: 440px; min-width: 340px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0;">
          <div class="nft-controls-panel" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; width: 100%; background: #23232b; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.10); padding: 18px 18px 10px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; border: 1.5px solid #29293a;">
            <div class="nft-collection-seed-row"></div>
            <div class="nft-rarity-seed-row"></div>
            <div class="nft-seedlist-random-row"></div>
            <div class="nft-seedinput-row"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="nft-preview-image-area"><div id="nft-preview-container"></div></div>
          <div id="display-full-seed-list-btn-mount"></div>
